    using a monster with its same name as material; Special Summon "Salamangreat"
    monster(s) from your hand and/or GY in Defense Position, up to the number of
    that monster''s Link Rating. You can only use 1 "Will of the Salamangreat" effect
    per turn, and only once that turn.'
